🔹 Topic: Amazon API Gateway — Build, Secure & Scale Your APIs Effortlessly
In modern cloud-native and serverless architectures, Amazon API Gateway plays a vital role in connecting front-end applications with back-end microservices or Lambda functions.
 It enables developers to create, publish, secure, and monitor APIs at any scale with minimal operational overhead.

Scales automatically to handle millions of API requests Pay only for the API calls you receive.

